      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Just a line while I have time to gratulate you and wish you every blessing. Mary Casey just phoned - is coming out this p.m. to have a little visit, before going back to-night to camp. ... Her mother Emma scalded herself recently rather badly and James Jr. had an operation oo his lez. .... otherwise things seem about as usual on the Coast. I wrote Pr. Edward a few days ago - have not had word from him in a long time. I know he has very little time for himself - what quite pleases him, I think. .... God bless you now and all my old friends in \"City of fine Schools, Villas & Terraces\"",
      "per_polygon": "Just a line while I have time to gratulate you and wish you every blessing. Mary Casey just phoned - is coming out this p.m. to have a little visit, before going back to-night to camp. .. Her mother Emma scalded herself recently rather badly and James Jr. had an operation oo his les. ... . otherwise things seem about as usual on the Coast. I wrote Fr. Edward a few days ago - have not bad word from him in a long time. I know he has very little time for himself - what quite pleases him, I think. God bless you now and all my old friends in \"City of fine Schools, Villas & Terraces\"",
